OL,3,CMan killed in crash after car hits wall
OL,5,FA man has been killed after a car he
OL,6,Fwas driving crashed into a wall near
OL,7,FHalifax.
OL,9,FIt happened on Sunday afternoon when
OL,10,Fthe Nissan Note was travelling along
OL,11,Fthe A58 towards Hipperholme when it
OL,12,Fveered and hit the stone wall.
OL,14,FThe 70-year-old man who was driving
OL,15,Fwas given medical treatment but sadly
OL,16,Fdied at the scene.
